    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "LE FILLIOU IDÉAL",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "not deciding\n\nnot choosing\n\nnot wanting\n\nnot owning\n\naware of self\n\nwide awake",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "SITTING QUIETLY,\n\nDOING NOTHING",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "\"Action poem\", Paris, 1964. Performed in 1965\n\nat the Café au Go-Go in New York as Part Two\n\nof the action poem Yes.",
